<assemblage xml:id="dad" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>:logo: This Work is Dedicated to my <em>Dad</em></title>

    <p>
        Thank you for always believing in me and supporting my academic pursuits. I would not be who I am today without
        your enthusiasm, advice, generosity, and willingness to nurture my curiosity. You are the one who introduced
        me to the beauty of mathematics and physics, and your faith in me gives me the confidence to have faith in what
        I've built and continue my academic journey wholeheartedly.
    </p>

    <p>
        This project would not exist without your support. Thank you for helping me build it, and for your patience as I
        learned to code and create websites such as this one.
    </p>

    <p>
        <em>I love you so much</em>, and I look forward to seeing you in the next chapter.
    </p>

</assemblage>
